  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "詩選及習作(一)",
    "sub_ename": "SEL. READINGS IN CHINESE POETRY & WRITING PRACTICE(1)",
    "describe_ch": "詩是中國文學的菁華，唐代是詩發展的高峰，詩人們把唐代的社會點綴得五彩繽紛，研究唐代詩人及其詩作，是中國文學系學生所必須學習的重點。本課程除了介紹詩的格律之外，並將唐代詩歌分為初、盛、中、晚四個階段，上學期教授初盛唐詩作，下學期教授中晚唐詩作。",
    "describe_eh": "Poetry is one of the most brilliant treasures of Chinese literature. It was in the Tang dynasty that Chinese poetry reached its peak and as a result the society of Tang period turned out to be extremely colorful. Therefore, it is necessary for the Chinese majors to learn and study major Tang poets and their works. This course will introduce the students to the prosody of Tang poetry. Four stages of development of Tang poetry are introduced and the first term will cover the first two stages while the second will deal with the other two. The course plans to train the students to have the ability to appreciate and analyze Tang poems and to compose poems according to the prosody of Jinti style.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
